<div class="row">
<div class="this-term col-sm-12">
  <div class="pref-label">soil sciences</div>
  <div class="scope-note">Earth sciences dealing with the origin, classification, physical, chemical, and biological properties of soils.</div>
  <div class="non-pref">This category is also used for <span class="uf">pedology (soils)</span></div>
</div>
</div>
